.TH MATRIX 1 "September 2026" "matrix 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
matrix \- realtime Matrix-style digital rain for the terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B matrix
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B matrix completions
\fISHELL\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B matrix
renders a polished Matrix-style digital rain animation in the terminal
using an alternate screen buffer. The cursor is hidden and the terminal
is restored on quit, Ctrl+C, or panic.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-speed\fR \fIFACTOR\fR
Fall speed multiplier (0.05–8).
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-density\fR \fIFRAC\fR
Column density as a fraction of terminal width (0.05–1).
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-fps\fR \fIN\fR
Frame rate cap.
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-color\fR \fINAME\fR
Palette: matrix, amber, cyberblue, red, purple, mono.
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-preset\fR \fINAME\fR
Named preset: hacker, screensaver, dense, sparse, slow, hyperspeed, nixos.
.TP
\fB\-\-charset\fR \fINAME\fR
Glyph set: classic, ascii, binary, hex, katakana, nix.
.TP
\fB\-\-chars\fR \fISTRING\fR
Custom glyphs (overrides --charset).
.TP
\fB\-\-trail\fR \fIFRAC\fR
Trail length factor (0.1–1).
.TP
\fB\-\-truecolor\fR [\fIBOOL\fR]
Force truecolor on or off.
.TP
\fB\-\-list\-presets\fR, \fB\-\-list\-charsets\fR, \fB\-\-list\-palettes\fR
List options and exit.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help.
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Show version.
.SH KEYS
.TP
q / Ctrl+C
Quit.
.TP
space
Pause / resume.
.TP
+ / \-
Speed.
.TP
] / [
Density.
.TP
c
Cycle palette.
.TP
p
Cycle preset.
.TP
? / h
Toggle help overlay.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI~/.config/matrix/config.toml\fR
User configuration (TOML).
